<view class="page bind-page">
  <view class="bind-head">
    <view class="eyebrow">Account</view>
    <view class="h1">绑定邮箱</view>
    <view class="muted bind-desc">
      绑定后可以用邮箱 + 密码登录，也能通过邮箱找回密码。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{hasEmail}}" class="card card-pad bind-card">
    <view class="bind-label">当前已绑定</view>
    <view class="bind-email">{{emailLabel}}</view>
    <view class="bind-note">
      微信和邮箱都可以登录同一个账号。如需更换邮箱，请联系客服。
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:else class="card card-pad bind-card">
    <view class="bind-field">
      <view class="bind-label">邮箱</view>
      <input
        class="bind-input"
        type="text"
        placeholder="you@example.com"
        value="{{email}}"
        bindinput="onEmailInput"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="bind-field">
      <view class="bind-label">验证码</view>
      <view class="bind-code-row">
        <input
          class="bind-input bind-code-input"
          type="number"
          maxlength="6"
          placeholder="6 位验证码"
          value="{{code}}"
          bindinput="onCodeInput"
        />
        <button
          class="bind-code-btn"
          bindtap="sendCode"
          disabled="{{sendingCode || countdown > 0}}"
        >
          <text wx:if="{{countdown > 0}}">{{countdown}}s</text>
          <text wx:else>发送验证码</text>
        </button>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="bind-field">
      <view class="bind-label">设置密码（首次绑定需要）</view>
      <input
        class="bind-input"
        password="{{true}}"
        placeholder="至少 8 位；已有账号可留空"
        value="{{password}}"
        bindinput="onPasswordInput"
      />
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{devCode}}" class="bind-hint">测试验证码：{{devCode}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="bind-notice">{{notice}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="bind-error">{{error}}</view>

    <button
      class="btn btn-primary bind-submit"
      hover-class="btn-hover"
      bindtap="submit"
      loading="{{submitting}}"
      disabled="{{submitting}}"
    >
      绑定邮箱
    </button>

    <view class="bind-note">
      如果该邮箱已经是 PsyPrac 账号，绑定后当前微信账号的做题、背单词记录会合并到该邮箱账号。
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
